---
description: Git commit messages do not credit Cursor
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git commits

Do not add a Cursor co-author line to a commit message. The message is only the change itself.

```
Prefer nullptr to NULL.
```

Do not append `Co-authored-by: Cursor`. Do not pass `--trailer` for a Cursor co-author. The commit author is the user only.
